WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.810
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.580
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:22.050
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.820
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.490
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:36.470
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:45.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:56.500
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.700
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.360
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.480
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:20.380
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:36.920
The eruption of a volcano
with tremendous energy.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:41.930
The year is 1883. At 9:56 AM
on August 26th,

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.710
Mt. Krakatoa on Krakatau erupted!

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:52.300
Hold your breath! The lava rushed
up to 5,400 m high in the air!

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:58.020
The eruption lasted for 10 days
and spread up to 5,300 km away!

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.820
The energy of it will shock you!

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:09.360
Historically it was the
biggest explosion ever,

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.360
26 times more powerful than an H-bomb.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:16.740
70 cubic millimeters! Sounds!
Spectacular colors by artist Go Nagai!

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.280
What was I talking about?

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.520
Well, it wasn't about the chalk.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.780
It looks like it's shaking.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.070
E-Earthquake!

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:18.810
DEMON MAGDLER
THE FLYING LAVA

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.470
This is the Tomei Broadcast Company.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.900
The lava erupting from Mt. Fuji has
been leaving fires in its wake.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.340
A government building 50 km from here
has been destroyed, as well.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:35.580
Due to the continuing quakes,
it's impossible to count

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:38.350
the number of casualties.
And it looks like...

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.950
it's about to claim another victim!

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.290
We now, we now---

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:04.780
Miki, come with me!

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:06.340
Akira...

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.890
So cool!

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:17.890
Miyo, come with me!

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.100
How uncool.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:33.670
SUNSTAR

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.870
Honestly! It's a shame
to spoil such beauty.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.810
Here we go.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.480
Well, thank you very much!

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.910
Incredible, that was huge!

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:17.110
It's getting even more incredible!

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.350
Come and get it!

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.970
It's so hot!

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.670
Devilman! Help me!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.300
Devilman!

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.080
HELP ME!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.620
Who's there?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:03.060
What's the matter?

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.990
I could've sworn I heard
someone calling me.

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.660
Akira...

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.260
It's Lala!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.470
Lala!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.710
Akira!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.610
Lala, where are you?

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.590
Here.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:30.590
Lala!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.300
Lala, where are you?

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.730
Don't come close!

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:47.860
Lala!

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.770
Look up at the sky.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.510
That's Demon Magdler!

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.820
He's a terrible one!

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:10.590
If he finds you, you'll burn to ashes.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.360
Just like me.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:20.930
But I'm so happy I met you, Akira.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:25.840
You gave me so
many happy memories.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.970
I just had to say that.

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:36.050
That's why I came out here.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:42.420
Farewell, Devilman.
Oh, listen to me.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:45.400
I'm still a romantic, right until I die.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.600
Lala...

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.540
Can't you at least let me finish?

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.280
What a bastard!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.010
I love you.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:13.250
Lala!

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:35.280
I'm so happy I met you, Akira.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:38.410
- Lala...
- Well, if it isn't Devilman!

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:56.190
Traitorous Devilman!
I won't let you run away!

00:09:56.190 --> 00:10:00.660
I'm not running away.
I refuse to fight on Lala's grave!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.280
This should be fine!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:22.960
DEVIL!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:32.430
Magdler fights with
the energy of the earth!

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:35.230
No matter how strong
you are, Devilman,

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:38.870
you will not have the power to keep
fighting over a week!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:45.970
But Magdler will not lose
the power to fight...

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:48.960
...as long as there is
magma inside the earth.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:52.720
Pathetic Devilman,
Your end is near.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.990
You can't move an
inch now, can you?

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:32.190
Devil Cutter!

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:39.800
What's wrong?
You intend to fight like this?

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.720
I got him!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.630
How dare you kill Lala!
You're gonna pay!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:22.840
Lord Xenon ordered me
to find and kill the traitors.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:26.340
Honestly, you're not
even worth my energy!

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.340
Don't talk so big!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.150
Foolish brat. Do not be
mistaken, you have not won!

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.450
What?

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:38.560
MAGDLER!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.490
The Sumida River!
It's erupting!

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:27.770
Behold my power, which causes
the earth's crust to move!

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:31.110
Your Devil Beam pales in comparison!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.120
Devil Wing!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:11.020
This isn't the first time we had
such a natural phenomenon.

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:16.080
30 years ago, Showa Shinzan rose
suddenly from a wheat field

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:19.450
following a great earthquake.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:22.920
Today, these have
become tourist attractions,

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:26.300
including places like Toyako in Hokkaido.
What will come from this now?

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:30.340
What're they gonna
name this new mountain?

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:35.140
We should be worried more
about Akira than the mountain.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:39.010
Where's he gone, anyway?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:43.040
Doesn't he always just
wander back eventually?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:46.320
You worry too much, Miki.

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:49.150
I'm not worried!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.750
Maybe... Oh, I know!

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:56.190
He went out looking
for Lala, and so...

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:58.190
You're jealous!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.600
You idiot! Of course not!

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:04.900
- Your horns are showing!
- Don't be ridiculous!

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:20.620
Anyway, where are you Akira?

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.570
Bastard! Dammit!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.140
Devil Chop!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.010
Devil Kick!

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:05.600
Dammit!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:33.000
Devil Beam!

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:52.250
MAGDLER!

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:07.720
It's always the same.
I'm gonna run out of power soon!

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:12.070
I can't give up. For the sake
of humanity and Lala.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:18.210
I'm so happy I met you, Akira.

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:21.000
I have to use brains, not brawns.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:25.210
This wretch should have a
weakness, but what is it?

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:32.250
That's it, out in space!

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:18.560
Burn, Devilman!
Burn, you traitor!

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:22.500
Burn in Lord Xenon's anger
and turn to ashes!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.700
Yeah right!

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:35.010
Fine, fly away if you wish.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:38.460
You will only exhaust
yourself more quickly.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:56.010
D-Devilman, where are you going?!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:59.040
- Right here.
- What?!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:06.370
Look, not even you can
burn in outer space!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.350
Curses!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:15.180
I can't afford to let
you get back to Earth.

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:16.150
Here I come!

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.390
Devil Chop!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:22.300
Devil Kick!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.500
Devil Arrow!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.020
I've defeated Magdler.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:53.230
Lala, you're so stupid.
You just had to die.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:57.760
Nope! I'm dead so my
stupidity is cured!

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:06.900
Is that so?
I guess you're right.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.180
Farewell, Lala.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:49.940
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:56.650
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.490 --> 00:21:04.300
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:10.140
Who Devilman really is

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:14.100
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:17.300
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:22.300
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:33.160
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:53.180
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:59.420
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:04.880
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:12.020
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.760
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.760 --> 00:22:19.770
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:26.480
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:36.590
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:05.520
Trees in the mountains and on
roadsides suddenly go on a rampage.

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:18.570
Akira hastily transforms
into Devilman to stop them.

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:25.870
But Tare sees him!

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:32.210
Devil Beam! Devil Arrow!

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:35.110
While Tare faints in shock,

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:38.490
Devilman laments over being
caught between the demands
of humans and demons.

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:43.160
The fun times he's shared with
Miki play over in his mind.

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:48.090
But he's forced to cut off his
memories as the trees attack.

00:23:48.090 --> 00:23:50.070
Devilman must mount a counterattack!

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:56.400
Miki, look out!

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:05.010
But there's no end to the
terrible rampaging trees.

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:23.560
YAMADA FAMILY GRAVE

00:24:29.300 --> 00:24:30.710
Devil Chop!

00:24:32.530 --> 00:24:34.170
Devil Kick!

00:24:34.170 --> 00:24:36.150
Devil Cutter!

00:24:36.540 --> 00:24:38.370
Help me!

00:24:38.370 --> 00:24:41.870
The death match between Devilman
and Demon Wooddou continues.

00:24:41.880 --> 00:24:43.910
Who will win this match?

00:24:43.910 --> 00:24:48.790
Next time on Devilman:
WOODDOU, THE ENRAGED GREENERY
